OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind and caring' hospice staff
OL,4,Aget highest rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "kind and caring" staff at a
OL,7,Fhospice have been given the highest
OL,8,Frating possible by inspectors.
OL,10,FTeesside Hospice, based in
OL,11,FMiddlesbrough, runs a 10-bed inpatient
OL,12,Funit as well as a wellbeing centre,
OL,13,Fbereavement counselling and a
OL,14,Flymphoedema clinic.
OL,16,FOfficials from the Care Quality
OL,17,FCommission (CQC) inspected the service
OL,18,Fin June and have now confirmed the
OL,19,Fhospice's rating has improved from good
OL,20,Fto outstanding.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
