OL,3,GNEWSA'Kind and caring' hospice staff
OL,4,Aget highest rating
OL,5,
OL,6,FGill Hodgson-Reilly, CQC deputy
OL,7,Fdirector for north-east England, said
OL,8,Fit was "an exceptional service" where
OL,9,Fstaff "worked hard to provide the best
OL,10,Fpossible care to people at the end of
OL,11,Ftheir lives".
